{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself stranded on a small island. Can you find the way out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, help the locals,  and enjoy your little adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492020/extras/sheep_on_grass.gif?t=1741283573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skvears is a single-player game where you take on the role of an explorer, lost on an island. This game features  quests,  finding and using items, interaction with the island's people and animals. It's entirely casual and can be completed in half an hour. Skvears was originally created in 2014.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3492020?t=1741283573","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741283573","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492020/5d4c8d1d78ac7736e4026fee01f70ae3b1587a3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741283573","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492020/5d4c8d1d78ac7736e4026fee01f70ae3b1587a3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741283573","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself stranded on a small island. Can you find the way out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, help the locals,  and enjoy your little adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492020/extras/sheep_on